{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_06_title", "source_sha256": "a2cc98770bf08891f71cfec7de12b11dc3696bce2a1d60b5f1d482df5029184e", "ja": "今度のふろくは……コチラ！", "zh": "本期的附录是……这个！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_06_synopsis", "source_sha256": "22713bf0d73ee669248917d1fd1b41edcbf959a305fd2a62f284a57fdf9f4617", "ja": "いよいよ3人のお披露目イベント。普段とは\n違う層のお客さんに驚くプロデューサー。\nSNSも女の子のフォロワーが増えたという。\nそんな3人がふろくとして選んだのは、それ\nぞれのイメージのリップクリームだった。", "zh": "三位偶像的首次亮相活动终于来临。来场的\n客层与平时活动不同，让制作人很惊讶。\n偶像们的SNS上也增加了许多女性粉丝。\n而她们所选择的附录商品，\n是代表各自形象的护唇膏。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_06_1000_p", "source_sha256": "94af167ec909e626e63ccb47e4626559a3afea58690f98e568e7569347a4f341", "ja": "（今日は、今月号の『りるきゃん』の発売日……\nそして可憐達3人の、お披露目イベントだ！）", "zh": "（今天是这个月《莉露甜心》的发售日……\n于是可怜她们三个举办了首次亮相活动！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_06_1001_null", "source_sha256": "c83b66a4653000e04251c70eb1bdd774a690788cdf3696ad6c1ef7a0fa3e9901", "ja": "ザワザワ……ザワザワ……", "zh": "（吵杂……吵杂……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_06_1002_p", "source_sha256": "0cdd6ac6528358515bc1cc8f0c5a5e3ce1e22b7de0faf031d34c4f2a3e3b62d7", "ja": "（それにしても、普段とお客さんの層が大分違うな。\n『りるきゃん』読者の子達だから、当然だけど……）", "zh": "（仔细一看，来场的观众客层和平时差很多呢。\n毕竟是《莉露甜心》的读者，这也是理所当然……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_06_1003_023aka", "source_sha256": "7894d5aa33d299eed86db539771765e70d86dad972f32490fd2e92c0827679c5", "ja": "「もうすぐ、イベントステージ始まるよー♪\nみんな、茜ちゃんたちに会いに来てね！」……っと。", "zh": "「活动马上就要开始啰～♪\n大家要来看小茜我们喔！」……送出。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_06_1004_023aka", "source_sha256": "081dc1cad4dda1194f1bb6b12733db1b61244c1e274c66806133b3f215ea85ff", "ja": "……よし、投稿完了♪", "zh": "……好，发完文了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_06_1005_p", "source_sha256": "f02dc216028a641edf41ee1df80e4ac0c0198ba9772cc17611242bf6b09fd05d", "ja": "翼、茜、可憐、お疲れ！\nもうすぐ本番だから、スマホはしまわないと……。", "zh": "翼、茜、可怜，辛苦了！\n活动就快开始了，快把手机收起来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_06_1006_045kar", "source_sha256": "1bad7fc8b10601616108c2f122e7bbcc85a25908d0c21876cd765f04ac3e3031", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}さん……\nお、お疲れさまです……。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生……\n辛、辛苦了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_06_1007_023aka", "source_sha256": "a2f9050b5259a1f3f9d4eacac132bccc8b5243aaf7e5c26e4c96c0688122342c", "ja": "茜ちゃんたち、今、楽屋で撮った写真をSNSに\n投稿してたんだよ！　……あ、もういいねがついた！", "zh": "小茜我们刚刚在休息室拍了照片，\n已经贴到SNS上啰！啊，有人按赞了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_06_1008_p", "source_sha256": "a0cb21ae2273b7fc3550dbe089679529d967938363f06250b1c617ccdfafa1da", "ja": "さすがSNS、反応が早いな。", "zh": "不愧是SNS，反应真快。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_06_1009_016tsu", "source_sha256": "4ca8e75d82f584875142b3350c461ba98ca055b4f9a41705b337ecbe8bbfa531", "ja": "あっ、わたしもわたしも！\n見て見て、{$P$}さん♪", "zh": "啊！我也要我也要！\n你看你看，{$P$}先生♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_06_1010_016tsu", "source_sha256": "375637311713a35b937f8303d3e92d292e7500c1ec468e4d5d5878bfb2762be3", "ja": "わたし、『りるきゃん』のイメージモデルになったって\n発表されてから、すっごくフォロワー増えたんですよ♪", "zh": "自从公布我成为《莉露甜心》的形象模特儿后，\n我就多了好多跟随者喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_06_1011_045kar", "source_sha256": "dbc6194dfde3c8d88bf847a80125b9057e8f45eaa1b418a8aeebc738e40fc8f0", "ja": "わ、私も……。年下の女の子から\nフォローされることが、ふ、増えました……。", "zh": "我、我也是……很多年纪比我小的女生、\n跟、跟随我了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_06_1012_023aka", "source_sha256": "9732d98ef647f0809c0735022436fce6fbb5b8da4e722e3a898f44760b87d4c9", "ja": "茜ちゃんたちのかわいさに、日本中が……\nいや、世界中が気づいてしまう日も近いね！", "zh": "再过不久，全日本……\n不，全世界都会注意到小茜我们的可爱魅力！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_06_1013_p", "source_sha256": "571422d1bd531dbbbeb584a37bacd17ed0f9f3d7a9f350630c880374a91678f0", "ja": "そうか。幅広い層に注目されているんだな。", "zh": "这样啊，看来你们受到广大客层关注呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_06_1015_p", "source_sha256": "bfc0bd7f297384bcea07821af75ef1f709801d88013fbec0c744993ff409565d", "ja": "ところで、『りるきゃん』のふろく内容のほうは、\nどうなってるんだ？", "zh": "对了，《莉露甜心》的附录内容，\n你们想得怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_06_1016_016tsu", "source_sha256": "4fd109465f5a1e17b00abf0eca33a1e8cb8ca2ac4aad040eb2f2d5a018717e7e", "ja": "それなら、わたしはアレがいいと思うな～。\nね？　茜ちゃん、可憐さん！", "zh": "关于附录，我觉得那个东西很不错喔～\n对吧？小茜、可怜！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_06_1017_045kar", "source_sha256": "e5f797723bba89a18026295e9f5f3882e7e948e6d8e18bc7de2dba89efbd0b30", "ja": "あ……！\nアレですね……！", "zh": "啊……！\n是那个对吧……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_06_1018_023aka", "source_sha256": "ee82fada5ed94a8fddfa4f0dd202db6816077552febc3395bbe288cc7c46ae5e", "ja": "茜ちゃん的にも異論なし！\n茜ちゃんたちの、思い出のアイテムだしね！", "zh": "小茜也没有异议！\n毕竟那是代表小茜我们回忆的物品嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_06_1019_p", "source_sha256": "4205f29512a7e88714cf19ad213b1650b956706a04edb4a1effa39f9792c996e", "ja": "アレっていうのは、一体……？", "zh": "你们说的那个究竟是……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_06_1020_045kar", "source_sha256": "013ae99876fab356ef803fb07c125afeaadbef75a56aa20029b60a15d015ba02", "ja": "はい……さ、撮影で、緊張している私に、\n翼ちゃんと茜ちゃんが出してくれた……。", "zh": "其实……就、就是之前我在拍照时，\n小翼和小茜拿出来给我舒缓紧张的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_06_1021_016tsu", "source_sha256": "474b5a4ba978bcd161d2e648e3a3ee7004000c44bc12b244b4cc3f8cc6404dcf", "ja": "じゃーん！　これです。\n香りつきのリップクリーム♪", "zh": "锵锵──！就是这个。\n香味护唇膏♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_06_1022_045kar", "source_sha256": "a8589e13091ba3bd9e5c56f73edceee95c855a3d7a22831f8811a47e4abac49f", "ja": "あ、あれからまた、みんなでお店に行って……\nいろんな香りを、試してみたんです……。", "zh": "后、后来我们又一起去店里……\n试了不同香味的护唇膏……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_06_1023_045kar", "source_sha256": "26c6370b246e389a594a31a5cf5b4c1a23b0eb7b1772029d47260ed25dd7f5df", "ja": "その時に……「『りるきゃん』のふろくには、\nこれがいいんじゃないか」って話になって……。", "zh": "那时候……我们聊到\n「用这个当《莉露甜心》的附录，或许是个好主意」……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_06_1024_023aka", "source_sha256": "e1e922fb966dd48c85be6571fd90bc38c93294a63705bb0630a80dd0d6179bc4", "ja": "でね、ココが茜ちゃんたちの鋭いトコロなんだけど。\n気づいたワケだよ。みんな、好きな香りが違うと！", "zh": "然后，小茜此时就发挥出敏锐的直觉了，\n小茜发现大家喜欢的香味都不尽相同！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_06_1025_016tsu", "source_sha256": "e5a0b529db8a89d1c61a17c8778acad4bafbd9f25ad208989cfe1450ad271774", "ja": "だから、わたしたちの好みとかイメージで、\n3種類の香りを用意してもらえないかな？って。", "zh": "所以，我们就想说，不知道能不能配合\n我们的喜好或是形象，准备三种香味护唇膏？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_06_1026_016tsu", "source_sha256": "b1969399ddfdf142e08a7dc508c246bf6c0f97cbdac56568a46bbc56b86d7c8f", "ja": "それに、好きな香りを選べたほうが\n絶対、テンション上がるよね？", "zh": "而且，能够选择自己喜欢的香味，\n读者一定也会更开心吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_06_1027_045kar", "source_sha256": "47e28f7571efc610188347f266348f7565ea07f815e9eaa1eb4c91213d2d0fae", "ja": "ひとりひとりは違う、別の香りだけど……\nお、おそろいのアイテムです……！", "zh": "虽然三个人的香味都不一样……\n不、不过还是同款的护唇膏……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_06_1028_p", "source_sha256": "95b9a6fdc7f0439cc4b788f12eafdef722a62d26ae8b8a32dd959b0559786f7a", "ja": "3種類の選べるリップクリームか……\nよし、それで編集長さんに提案してみよう！", "zh": "三种护唇膏提供选择吗……\n好，我去向总编提案看看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_06_1029_016tsu", "source_sha256": "561e9c40988a6fb6d1dce62f79478ed9726b8e563362d6748e20125b71a16be6", "ja": "やったあ♪　{$P$}さん、\nよろしくお願いしまーす！", "zh": "太好了♪{$P$}先生，\n麻烦你啰──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_06_1030_023aka", "source_sha256": "eb98100894786b2f74d29c7cfe9273b21e7f02745e59d8bf11b158d4bf083d34", "ja": "ふろくのプロデュースがうまくいくかどうかは、\n{$P$}ちゃんの手腕にかかっている！", "zh": "附录的企划能不能通过，\n就要仰赖小{$P$}的交涉手腕了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_06_1031_p", "source_sha256": "0348a077956febffa72d1dcd61278621c61b3f1c6e569752f5f4ce1646a39b52", "ja": "（それぞれのイメージのリップクリーム……\nいいアイディアだ。なんとか実現させないとな）", "zh": "（代表各自形象的护唇膏……\n真是不错的点子，我一定要想办法实现。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_06_1032_p", "source_sha256": "d8a6bdf841a407ba39d1f078455eb238ee594fc76d9756ca9ab6b3f1c74d608a", "ja": "（3人の『りるきゃん』プロデュースのために、\n俺もしっかり、3人をプロデュースしていこう！）", "zh": "（为了她们三个的《莉露甜心》企划，\n我也要好好培育她们！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
